  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Torit health centre support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Any individual who present to the health facility or identified in the community 
The project will be inclusive to meet the health needs and priorities of host community,refugees,returnees and internally displaced person.
The project will attend all beneficiaries regardless of age,gender,religion,race,colour and all other social construct</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Torit is supporting 3 health centres, over the past period with the support of Caritas Luxembourg. Due to circumstances, the support of C Luxembourg was suddenly finished, and therefore support was sought of other CIMOs to continue the support to C Torit. Cordaid, Caritas Japan, Caritas Italy and Caritas France have put their strength together to ensure continuation of the basic services in the health centre until the end of January 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to 3 health centers managed by CTSS: Kapoeta Mission Hospital / Saint Bakhita PHCC /Magwi PHCC 
Reduce morbidity and mortality among vulnerable communities in Kapoeta South and Magwi counties</narrative>
  </description>
